  "notes": "Both venvs rebuilt with Python 3.12, installing the intentkit subpackage in editable mode (KT_PKGDIR=intentkit) plus requests-oauthlib, tweepy[async] and psycopg[binary]; the workspace root has no package to build. The workload adds the matching side's src to sys.path and uses the project's own in-memory SQLite DB fallback (init_db). The X token endpoint (network) is replaced by a requests adapter mounted on oauth2_user_handler that returns token JSON after a 4 ms simulated delay. It runs refresh_expiring_tokens over 24 agents (some refresh tokens are rejected, so the error path runs), direct refresh_token calls, and the empty early-return path. Head uses asyncio.to_thread and gather (worker threads). Coverage 100% on both sides, outputs equal."
